## Ponder Indexer Development Rules

### Type Checking
- **ALWAYS run `pnpm tsc --noEmit` after completing each milestone** to ensure TypeScript compilation is successful
- Run `pnpm tsc --noEmit` after any significant code changes to catch type errors early

### Linting
- Linting setup is required (see TODO list)
- Once linting is configured, run linting checks as part of the milestone completion process

### Development Workflow
- After schema changes, verify compilation with `pnpm tsc --noEmit`
- After handler implementations, test with `pnpm dev` (if available) or build with `pnpm build`
- Maintain type safety throughout the migration

